This plugin is the official DeepSeek Harness integration for ZeroMem
(https://github.com/IMLIULIAN/zeromem), sharing its SQLite schema and
evidence-grounded extraction/admission protocol. Companion local model
weights Qwen3.5-4B-Memory-V2 (derived from Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B) are distributed
separately under Apache-2.0.

Schema Lineage & Third-Party Ecosystem Compatibility:
The structured fact-extraction and pre-write admission schema conventions shared
with ZeroMem (including bank/namespace partitioning, fact types
"world" / "experience" / "observation", temporal fields occurred_start /
occurred_end / mentioned_at, and where / entities metadata) are inspired by and
conceptually compatible with Vectorize Hindsight
(https://github.com/vectorize-io/hindsight, MIT License). This plugin's
node:sqlite dual-track FTS5 store, admission/guardrail pipeline, governance and
lossless restore layer, and DSH integration are independent clean-room
implementations containing no Hindsight source code.

Name Disambiguation:
ZeroMem (零忆) and @imliulian/dsh-zeromem (by IMLIULIAN / B站IM榴莲 / ZeroZoneX)
are independent open-source local memory projects and are not affiliated with,
derived from, or related to the academic paper "Zero-Mem: Zero-Token Memory
Operations for LLM Agents" (Yilin Xiao et al., arXiv:2607.29377, July 2026).
